00:12:35.701 --> 00:12:38.234
-Ohh.

00:12:38.234 --> 00:12:40.400
Come on.
-Higgins, do you want --

00:12:40.400 --> 00:12:43.200
Do you know anything
about Uranus?

00:12:43.200 --> 00:12:45.701
-Well, I know it's the seventh
planet from the sun.

00:12:45.701 --> 00:12:47.100
-Interesting.

00:12:47.100 --> 00:12:50.067
-It's also the third-largest
planet in the solar system.

00:12:50.067 --> 00:12:52.067
It's almost four times larger
than Earth.

00:12:52.067 --> 00:12:54.501
-That's it?
-Um...

00:12:54.501 --> 00:12:58.334
It also reminds me of,
you know, "your anus,"

00:12:58.334 --> 00:12:59.734
you know, like, the words.
-Yeah, that's what I --

00:12:59.734 --> 00:13:01.367
-Is it the Red Planet?

00:13:01.367 --> 00:13:03.834
No, it's a brown planet, right?
Uranus?

00:13:03.834 --> 00:13:05.400
-I-I wouldn't know.

00:13:05.400 --> 00:13:07.100
Are you talking about Uranus,
as a whole?

00:13:07.100 --> 00:13:09.467
-Yeah.
Not a black hole, though.

00:13:09.467 --> 00:13:10.801
That's a different...
-Yeah, different thing.

00:13:10.801 --> 00:13:13.400
-...celestial body.
-Thank you.

00:13:13.400 --> 00:13:15.901
Well, guys, today is 4/20,

00:13:15.901 --> 00:13:18.100
and oddly enough, tomorrow...
[ Cheering and applause ]

00:13:18.100 --> 00:13:20.234
Yeah. Happy 4/20, everyone.
Tomorrow --

00:13:20.234 --> 00:13:22.334
[ Cheering and applause ]

00:13:25.968 --> 00:13:28.701
