00:13:30.734 --> 00:13:32.734
[ Cheering and applause ]
Yeah. That's right.

00:13:34.300 --> 00:13:37.467
One day after 4/20.

00:13:37.467 --> 00:13:39.934
I mean, really?
That's like Chipotle offering

00:13:39.934 --> 00:13:41.467
