00:13:41.467 --> 00:13:42.567
You know what I'm saying?

00:13:42.567 --> 00:13:45.467
[ Laughter ]

00:13:47.734 --> 00:13:50.701
Meanwhile, police say that a man
in West Virginia was arrested

00:13:50.701 --> 00:13:52.400
after he was pulled over,

00:13:52.400 --> 00:13:54.167
