00:13:55.834 --> 00:13:59.133
[ Laughter ]

00:13:59.133 --> 00:14:02.167
His lawyer was like,
"Your Honor -- I got nothing.

00:14:02.167 --> 00:14:04.767
I..."

00:14:04.767 --> 00:14:06.601
And, finally,
did you guys see the picture

00:14:06.601 --> 00:14:08.467
