00:14:13.901 --> 00:14:15.601
Here it is.
Here it is right -- Yeah.

00:14:15.601 --> 00:14:17.400
-Whoa.
[ Audience oohs ]

00:14:17.400 --> 00:14:20.367
-Yeah, well, Macron is running
for reelection right now,

00:14:20.367 --> 00:14:22.634
and he actually asked us
