[ Cheering and applause ]

00:16:04.033 --> 00:16:07.167
Thank you. That applause lasted
longer than CNN+.

00:16:07.167 --> 00:16:09.267
[ Laughter ]

00:16:09.267 --> 00:16:11.133
That's right.
If you haven't heard, today

00:16:11.133 --> 00:16:14.200
