"storming" anywhere.

00:17:11.801 --> 00:17:14.033
[ Laughter ]

00:17:14.033 --> 00:17:16.300
If you haven't seen the clip,
here it is.

00:17:18.634 --> 00:17:20.100
-I don't think you're real.

00:17:20.100 --> 00:17:22.300
Very dishonest.
Let's finish up the interview.

00:17:23.701 --> 00:17:25.100
Turn the camera off.

00:17:25.100 --> 00:17:26.734
Very dishonest.

00:17:26.734 --> 00:17:30.067
[ Laughter ]

00:17:30.067 --> 00:17:33.200
-My only question is has Trump
been living at Mar-a-Lago

00:17:33.200 --> 00:17:34.968
or under a heat lamp
at Golden Corral?

00:17:34.968 --> 00:17:36.934
[ Laughter ]
I was wondering.

00:17:36.934 --> 00:17:40.133
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:17:40.133 --> 00:17:41.868
I was wondering that.

00:17:41.868 --> 00:17:43.501
He's done!
-Nice.

00:17:43.501 --> 00:17:45.834
-Flip him over!

00:17:45.834 --> 00:17:48.100
-Texas toast.
[ Laughter ]

00:17:48.100 --> 00:17:51.901
-Speaking of crazy things on TV,
last night was a new episode of

00:17:51.901 --> 00:17:54.968
