00:18:14.968 --> 00:18:17.200
♪ Bad to the bone ♪

00:18:17.200 --> 00:18:20.901
♪ Bad, real bad, very bad ♪

00:18:20.901 --> 00:18:23.834
[ Laughter ]

00:18:25.667 --> 00:18:28.467
-You know, it actually takes
talent not to hit any notes.

00:18:28.467 --> 00:18:30.534
I think that's
actually interesting.
[ Laughter ]

00:18:30.534 --> 00:18:33.234
After seeing that, the CDC
reinstated the mask mandate.

00:18:33.234 --> 00:18:35.367
They're like,
"Put the mask back on now.

00:18:35.367 --> 00:18:37.734
Now we're putting the mask
back on."

00:18:37.734 --> 00:18:39.133
That's right.

00:18:39.133 --> 00:18:41.400
[ Cheering and applause ]

00:18:41.400 --> 00:18:44.133
"Just put it -- For all of us."

00:18:44.133 --> 00:18:46.734
Well, this was nuts.
Last night, the Army --

00:18:46.734 --> 00:18:48.434
