Thank you for being here.

00:20:48.300 --> 00:20:50.200
That was good. Not bad.

00:20:52.100 --> 00:20:53.634
That's the real --
-Aw, such a thrill.

00:20:53.634 --> 00:20:56.234
-Times Square Applebee's, go get
