Yeah, everyone is trying
to do their part.

00:22:03.634 --> 00:22:05.734
As we speak,
CNN is properly disposing

00:22:05.734 --> 00:22:08.667
of CNN+.
[ Laughter ]

00:22:08.667 --> 00:22:09.868
In honor of Earth Day,

00:22:09.868 --> 00:22:12.167
I saw that President Biden
visited Seattle

00:22:12.167 --> 00:22:16.801
and signed an executive order
to safeguard old-growth forests.

00:22:16.801 --> 00:22:19.200
That's great. Can we see
an old-growth forest?

00:22:19.200 --> 00:22:20.300
[ Laughter and applause ]
Oh, look at that chest hair.

00:22:20.300 --> 00:22:22.000
Yeah, that's nice.
Look at that chest hair.

00:22:22.000 --> 00:22:23.534
-Ooh la la.
-[ French accent ] Oh, am I

00:22:23.534 --> 00:22:24.601
sexy enough for you?

00:22:24.601 --> 00:22:26.067
[ Laughter ]
Yeah. Yeah.

00:22:26.067 --> 00:22:27.367
While Biden was in Seattle,

00:22:27.367 --> 00:22:30.667
he also spoke about the need
for using clean energy

00:22:30.667 --> 00:22:33.033
and he even demonstrated
how powerful windmills can be.

00:22:33.033 --> 00:22:34.067
Watch this.

00:22:34.067 --> 00:22:37.434
[ Whirring ]

00:22:37.434 --> 00:22:38.501
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:22:38.501 --> 00:22:39.501
Yeah.

00:22:39.501 --> 00:22:42.267
Oh, there you go.
They are powerful.

00:22:42.267 --> 00:22:44.100
Ahead of Earth Day,

00:22:44.100 --> 00:22:46.834
Apple announced that it is using
more recycled materials

00:22:46.834 --> 00:22:49.467
to make its products
than ever before.

00:22:49.467 --> 00:22:50.934
Yeah, recycled iPhones.

00:22:50.934 --> 00:22:53.300
It's weird when you turn on your
new iPhone and Siri says --

00:22:53.300 --> 00:22:54.934
-I used to be a Shake Weight.

00:22:54.934 --> 00:22:55.834
-Okay.
I don't know.

00:22:55.834 --> 00:22:59.567
[ Laughter ]

00:22:59.567 --> 00:23:02.267
Guys, the second weekend
of Coachella just kicked off

00:23:02.267 --> 00:23:04.167
and I heard that,
since the first weekend,

00:23:04.167 --> 00:23:07.868
COVID cases in the area
have gone up by 77%.

00:23:07.868 --> 00:23:08.968
[ Oohs and ohs ]

00:23:08.968 --> 00:23:10.467
Everyone there is like,
"I can't believe

00:23:10.467 --> 00:23:12.634
this is happening
when we're doing everything

00:23:12.634 --> 00:23:14.000
we're not supposed to do!"

00:23:14.000 --> 00:23:15.400
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:23:15.400 --> 00:23:17.100
The Tony Awards are coming up

00:23:17.100 --> 00:23:20.601
and they just issued
a strict no-violence policy...

00:23:20.601 --> 00:23:21.968
[ Laughter ]

00:23:21.968 --> 00:23:23.734
...to potential ticket buyers.

00:23:25.200 --> 00:23:27.400
That's right, the Tonys,
no violence.

00:23:27.400 --> 00:23:29.300
No violence, yeah.
Because you can always tell

00:23:29.300 --> 00:23:30.567
a fight's going to break out
at the Tonys

00:23:30.567 --> 00:23:31.901
when people start snapping.

00:23:31.901 --> 00:23:33.300
[ Snapping fingers ]
♪♪

00:23:33.300 --> 00:23:34.400
[ Laughter ]

00:23:34.400 --> 00:23:35.634
♪ Hey, boy ♪

00:23:35.634 --> 00:23:39.667
♪♪

00:23:39.667 --> 00:23:40.734
I appreciate it.

00:23:40.734 --> 00:23:43.934
[ Cheering and applause ]

00:23:43.934 --> 00:23:45.868
Water?

00:23:45.868 --> 00:23:46.701
-Oxygen?

00:23:46.701 --> 00:23:47.934
-Some business news --

00:23:47.934 --> 00:23:51.601
I read that the CEO of Old Navy
is stepping down.

00:23:51.601 --> 00:23:53.968
Now, Old Navy's going to try on
a dozen new CEOs

00:23:53.968 --> 00:23:55.200
before finding one that fits

00:23:55.200 --> 00:23:56.467
and leaving the rest
on the floor.

00:23:56.467 --> 00:23:58.501
[ Laughter and applause ]
It's very interesting.

00:23:58.501 --> 00:24:00.267
And, finally, this weekend,

00:24:00.267 --> 00:24:04.067
two stunt pilots will attempt
the first ever plane swap.

00:24:04.067 --> 00:24:05.701
This is where they're going
to fly close together,

00:24:05.701 --> 00:24:07.200
go into a nosedive,

00:24:07.200 --> 00:24:09.667
then jump into each other's
planes before landing.

00:24:09.667 --> 00:24:11.868
[ Laughter and ohs ]
Yeah, it'll be the one time

00:24:11.868 --> 00:24:14.133
the pilot actually deserves
applause for landing the plane.

